---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description={SITE.tagline}>
  <div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head"><h1>About</h1></header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I build systems. Some run on code, some run on hardware, and most end up being a mix of both.</p>
    <p>
      I work across JavaScript (Node, TypeScript, React), Java, Python and C, with a focus on AI
      orchestration, agentic systems and multi-modal pipelines. I run my own infrastructure and build
      image-generation pipelines with ComfyUI and custom Python tooling.
    </p>
    <p>
      Recently: a request router that moved a routing decision off a 9B model onto a Jetson Orin Nano,
      measured on a sealed test (<a href="/projects/five-lane-router">details</a>), and a shared memory
      server for a fleet of agents (<a href="/projects/musubi">Musubi</a>).
    </p>
    <p>Outside of that: guitar, sound design, visual work, and building things that don't fit neatly into categories.</p>
    <p>Based in {SITE.location}.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</Base>
